content.notes:
- RIFTBEAST stage 2, 3, 4: Buff on your carry (Cinderling / Pebbles);
- RIFTBEAST stage 5+: Buff on Scuttlecrab or Elder Dragon (if you need more DMG / execute);
- itemise CINDERLING > PEBBLES;
- stage 2-5 or 3-1 lvl 5 roll for Pebbles and Cinderling -> need them at least 2star & roll for 5 Riftbeast
- keep rolling stage 3 for 3star Pebbles/Cinderling;
- push lvl 7 in stage 3-5 or 4-1 and roll for 7 Riftbeasts -> big powerspike, should be able to win whole of stage 3;

